WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.288
Two things were missing.

2
00:00:01.288 --> 00:00:02.701
The first was this guard.

3
00:00:02.701 --> 00:00:06.391
The client already skipped a record
with an empty intended state,

4
00:00:06.391 --> 00:00:10.834
but not one whose intended state was a
non-empty object naming nothing, which is

5
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:15.413
exactly what ServiceNow stores for a native
change the workflow didn't describe.

6
00:00:15.413 --> 00:00:18.418
Comparing a read against
that finds no difference,

7
00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:22.425
so the client would have closed the
record, with evidence, on nothing.

8
00:00:22.425 --> 00:00:25.511
Now Chapter 1's check runs
before anything is read,

9
00:00:25.511 --> 00:00:29.260
and such a record is skipped
with the reason, never verified.
